UPDATE companies SET description='All County Sheet Metal was founded in 1982 in Lake Worth Beach, Florida, and has operated from a shop near I-95 at Exit 64 on 10th Avenue North.

The shop produces both standard and custom sheet metal products, with a focus on HVAC components such as auxiliary drain pans, ductwork, and roofing fixtures, as well as curbs and doghouse covers. Processes include MIG (GMAW) welding, spot welding, hot iron and torch soldering, and plasma cutting on a Vulcan system with supporting software. Manual layout and design assistance from a network of professional mechanical and structural engineers are also available. Jobs range in value from $45 to over $10,000, and the company maintains a production line for stock items that are available for immediate pickup.

Primary customers are HVAC contractors, but the company also supports plumbers, roofers, property managers, electricians, and individual homeowners. Its accounts span from individual buyers to Fortune 500 companies, and the shop emphasizes that no job is too small.

All County Sheet Metal states its goal is to deliver quality products and service in a timely manner.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom sheet metal fabrication", "Standard sheet metal products", "MIG (GMAW) welding", "Spot welding", "Hot iron welding", "Torch soldering", "Plasma cutting (Vulcan system)", "Manual layout", "Design assistance (mechanical/structural engineering)", "Production line for pans, roofing fixtures, curbs"], "industries": ["HVAC", "Plumbing", "Roofing", "Property management", "Electrical", "Residential/Individual"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Vulcan Plasma cutting system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Immediate pickup for stocked items", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Stocked sheet metal items available for immediate pickup", "Full-time welder on staff with MIG, spot welding, hot iron, and torch soldering capabilities", "Vulcan plasma cutting system with integrated software for duct fittings", "Design assistance from a network of professional mechanical and structural engineers", "Bilingual office staff and membership in PBACCA"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1982 -> db", "Headquarters Lake Worth Beach, FL -> db", "Serves South Florida since 1982 -> /", "Shop location near I-95 Exit 64 -> /", "Manufactures standard and custom sheet metal products -> /", "Main customers HVAC industry, also plumbers, roofers, property managers, electricians, individuals -> /", "Accounts from individuals to Fortune 500 companies -> /", "Standard line includes auxiliary drain pans, duct work, roofing fixtures -> /", "Many items in stock for immediate pickup -> /", "Full-time welder on staff, MIG (GMAW) welding -> /", "Spot welding, hot iron, torch soldering available -> /", "Vulcan Plasma cutting system with software for duct fittings -> /", "Manual layout experience -> /", "Design assistance from network of Professional Mechanical and Structural Engineers -> /", "Typical drawings customizable -> /", "Job range $45 to over $10,00