UPDATE companies SET description='American Automotive LLC operates as a Rhino Linings applicator in Livingston, Montana. The location at 320 1/ provides professionally installed spray-on protective coatings for vehicles and equipment.

The shop applies Rhino Linings'' multi-component polyurea and polyurethane formulas to truck beds, marine surfaces, trailer floors, and a range of commercial, industrial, and military equipment. The process includes deep cleaning, masking, mechanical scuffing with a multi-speed polisher, compressed-air dust removal, and spray application that develops a textured finish. Installations typically take up to three hours, with same-day vehicle return and a 24-hour cure before heavy use. The facility uses Graco and PMC proportioning equipment and stocks genuine replacement parts.

Customers include individual truck owners, fleet operators, construction companies, emergency-vehicle upfitters, marine dealers, and military maintenance units. The applicator serves the automotive, marine, commercial, industrial, and defense sectors across the region, coating everything from ATVs and RVs to heavy construction machinery and tactical vehicles.

The location differentiates itself through the Rhino Linings Nationwide Limited Lifetime Warranty on bed liners, color-matching and custom-color capabilities, and a technician-trained installation process that the company says ensures permanent adhesion and resistance to cracking, peeling, and extreme temperatures from -40 °F to 190 °F.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Spray-on protective coating application", "Surface preparation (cleaning, mechanical scuffing)", "Masking and protection of non-coated areas", "Textured finish application", "Color matching and custom colors", "Truck bed liner installation", "Marine coating application", "Trailer floor coating", "Commercial equipment coating", "Industrial equipment coating", "Military vehicle coating", "Fleet vehicle coating", "Emergency vehicle coating", "ATV/UTV coating", "Boat and RV coating"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Marine", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Military/Defense", "Construction", "Emergency services", "Fleet management", "Recreational vehicles"], "materials": ["Rhino Linings spray-on coatings", "Multi-component polyurea/polyurethane formulas"], "equipment": ["Graco spray proportioning equipment", "PMC spray proportioning equipment", "Multi-speed polisher", "Compressed air systems"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day installation (up to 3 hours); 24 hours for full cure before heavy use", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Nationwide Limited Lifetime Warranty on bed liners", "Professionally installed by trained technicians", "Color matching and custom colors available", "Same-day installation (drop off morning, pick up same day)", "Service for automotive, marine, commercial, industrial, and military applications"], "facts_used": ["Location: Livingston, MT -> page ''/''", "Address: 320 1/2 North Main Street, Livingston, MT 59047 -> page ''/''", "Phone:  -> page ''/''", "Rhino Linings applicator -> page ''/''", "Spray-on bed liner installation process described -> page ''/''