UPDATE companies SET description='Aaloktronix, doing business as AalokTronix Inc. (ATI), is an electronics contract manufacturer headquartered in Seattle, Washington. The company does not publish its founding date or ownership details, though its website credits Kishan Ghadiya as the author of its primary content.

The firm provides full-spectrum electronics manufacturing services (EMS), including PCB assembly (prototype and turnkey), final assembly, electronic assembly, design and engineering (PCB layout, schematic capture, design for manufacturability), cable and wire harness assembly, circuit troubleshooting and repair, and quick-turn prototyping. It emphasizes automated electronic assembly, paperless documentation, and barcode tracking for traceability. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are disclosed.

Aaloktronix serves aerospace, defense, medical, commercial, IoT, industrial, agriculture, and automotive sectors. The company highlights aerospace-grade and medical-device PCB assembly as specialized offerings, along with custom wire and cable harnesses built to aerospace specifications.

The company positions itself on accommodating service—accepting customer-provided instructions or kits—high reliability through inspection at every production step, and punctual delivery regardless of order size. Its stated differentiator is a rapid prototyping timeline: a hardware prototype in as little as three weeks and a manufacturable product in under ten weeks.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100','ISO13485']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB assembly (prototype and turnkey)", "Final assembly", "Electronic assembly", "Design and engineering (PCB layout, schematic capture, design for manufacturability)", "Cable and wire harness assembly", "Circuit troubleshooting and repair", "Quick-turn prototyping", "Automated electronic assembly", "Paperless assembly documentation", "Barcode tracking and traceability", "Box-level product design", "Component sourcing", "Testing and repair"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Medical", "Commercial", "IoT", "Industrial", "Agriculture", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype and small volume", "lead_time": "Prototype in as little as 3 weeks; manufacturable product in less than 10 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quick-turn prototyping: hardware prototype in as little as 3 weeks, manufacturable product in less than 10 weeks", "Automated electronic assembly with paperless documentation and barcode tracking", "Accommodating service: responds to detailed assembly instructions and kits/files per customer preferences", "High reliability: inspects boards at all production steps", "Punctual delivery: fast electronic assembly and delivery regardless of product size"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Seattle, Washington -> db", "Business type: Electronics contract manufacturer (ECM) providing EMS -> /", "Certifications: AS9100, ISO13485 -> db", "Industries served: Aerospace, Defense, Medical, Commercial, IoT, Industrial, Agriculture, Automotive -> /", "Services: PCB assembly (prototype and turnkey), final assembly, electronic assembly, design and engineering, cable/wire harness, circuit troubleshooting/repair, quick-turn prototyping -> /", "Quick-turn prototyping timeline: prototype in as little as 3 weeks, manufacturable product in <10 weeks -> /", "Automated electronic assembly, paperless documentation, barcode tracking -> /", "Accommodating service, high reliability, punctual delivery claims -> /", "Author Kishan Ghadiya credited on pages -> /, /about, /services"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "As a leading electronics contract manufacturer (ECM) in Seattle, USA, AalokTronix (ATI) provides electronics manufacturing services (EMS)...", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='aaloktronix' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1910, Abbott operates from its headquarters in Roseville, Minnesota, with a deep-rooted presence in India where it has served the healthcare landscape for over a century. The company employs more than 12,000 people across urban and rural communities in India, reflecting a commitment to broad accessibility.

Abbott develops and manufactures a diverse portfolio spanning pharmaceuticals, nutritional products, medical devices, and diagnostic solutions. The company offers over 400 pharmaceutical brands in India alone, supported by large-scale manufacturing and distribution networks.

The company serves hospitals, medical environments, and healthcare providers across India and globally. Abbott’s network extends into practically every corner of the Indian subcontinent.

