UPDATE companies SET description='Absolute Electronics Services, based in Addison, Illinois, has provided PCB assembly solutions since 1995.

Its core offering centers on printed circuit board assembly using automated surface-mount and through-hole lines, with capabilities that include BGA placement, flexible circuit assembly, conformal coating, and rework and repair. Beyond bare-board assembly, the shop provides wire and cable harness fabrication, box-build integration, mechanical and electromechanical assembly, and full turnkey procurement alongside kitted or consigned material models. Inspection relies on automated optical inspection (AOI), 3D X-ray, in-circuit test, and functional test.

The customer base spans industrial equipment, LED lighting, RF/IoT/M2M, automotive, medical, telecommunications, and consumer electronics. Testimonials reference an industrial electronics manufacturer (Tescor Products LLC), a telecom manufacturer, and a consumer electronics manufacturer.

The company highlights its ITAR-registered, U.S.-based facility as a supply-chain security advantage, promising turnkey execution under one roof and lead times as short as 48 hours. Its stated differentiators also include military-grade inspection technology and domestic customer support from Addison.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly (SMT & Through-Hole)", "Quick Turn PCB Prototype", "Volume Production", "BGA Assembly", "Flex PCB Assembly", "Conformal Coating", "Wire & Cable Harness Assembly", "Wire Harness Design", "Ribbon Cable Assembly", "Multi-conductor Cable Assembly", "Box Build Assembly", "Mechanical and Electromechanical Assembly", "Turnkey Assembly (parts procurement to final assembly)", "Kitted/Consigned Assembly", "Mixed Assembly", "BGA Rework & Repair", "AOI (Automated Optical Inspection)", "3D X-ray Inspection", "ICT (In-Circuit Testing)", "Functional Testing", "Custom Labeling and Documentation", "Warehouse and Inventory Management", "Drop Shipping"], "industries": ["Industrial", "LED Lighting", "RF/IoT/M2M", "Automotive", "Medical", "Telecommunications", "Consumer Electronics"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["AOI (Automated Optical Inspection)", "3D X-ray Inspection"], "volume": "Quick turn prototypes to full-scale production", "lead_time": "As quick as 48 hours", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["USA-based, ITAR-registered facility", "Turnkey execution from component sourcing to final assembly under one roof", "Advanced inspection with AOI and 3D X-ray", "Flexible lead times as quick as 48 hours", "Domestic customer support and engineering assistance from Addison, IL"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1995 -> about", "Headquarters Addison, Illinois -> homepage, about", "ITAR registered -> homepage, certifications", "ISO 9001 certified -> quality", "Services: PCB Assembly (SMT, TH, BGA, Flex), Box Build, Wire Harness, Conformal Coating, BGA Rework -> services", "Industries: Industrial, LED Lighting, RF