UPDATE companies SET description='Ace Electronics was founded in 1978 in Metuchen, New Jersey, and operates as a service‑disabled veteran‑owned small business (SDVOSB) with additional woman‑owned small business (WOSB) and small business (SB) designations. The company began as a provider of customized cable assembly solutions and has expanded to three U.S. locations: Metuchen, NJ; Aberdeen Proving Ground, MD; and Troy, MI.

The company functions as a contract manufacturer specializing in wire harnesses, custom cable assemblies, electro‑mechanical box builds, and injection‑molded components. Its engineering services support design through production, and all manufacturing personnel are certified to IPC/WHMA‑A‑620 standards. Facilities across the three sites hold distinct CAGE codes (7Y943, 5TWH2, 6BXZ9) and maintain ITAR registration for defense work.

Ace Electronics serves defense, aerospace, robotics/industrial, medical, and rail sectors. Prime contractors such as BAE Systems and Lockheed Martin have recognized the firm with Partner 2 Win Gold and Silver Tier awards and an Exceptional Small Business Award, respectively. The company also holds a position on the Missile Defense Agency’s SHIELD IDIQ contract vehicle with a $151 billion ceiling.

Leadership emphasizes a warfighter‑focused approach, citing longevity, certified staff, and a commitment to listening to client requirements as differentiators. The firm highlights its ability to deliver customized interconnect solutions across multiple vehicle platforms while maintaining ISO 9001:2015 quality management.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ITAR','IPC/WHMA-A-620']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable assembly", "Wire harness construction", "Electro\u2011mechanical box build assembly", "Injection molding", "Engineering design services", "IPC/WHMA\u2011A\u2011620 certified assembly", "Weapon systems cable assemblies", "Ground systems cable assemblies", "Data systems cable assemblies", "Radio/communication cable assemblies", "Distribution panel assembly", "Airworthy cable assemblies", "Tactical cable assemblies"], "industries": ["Defense/Military", "Aerospace", "Robotics/Industrial", "Medical", "Rail", "General Industry"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["IPC/WHMA\u2011A\u2011620 compliant manufacturing", "ITAR registered for defense contracts", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "Service\u2011disabled veteran\u2011owned and woman\u2011owned small business", "Three U.S. facilities with separate CAGE codes"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1978 -> /", "Headquarters Metuchen, NJ -> /", "SDVOSB, WOSB, SB ownership -> /", "Three locations with CAGE codes 7Y943, 5TWH2, 6BXZ9 -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /", "ITAR registered -> /", "IPC/WHMA-A-620 compliant -> /", "Custom cable assemblies, wire harnesses, electro-mechanical box builds -> /", "Injection molding capability -> /", "Engineering services -> /", "Industries: Defense, Aerospace, Robotics/Industrial, Medical, Rail -> /", "BAE Systems Partner 2 Win Gold/Silver awards -> /", "Lockheed Martin Exceptional Small Business Award -> /", "MDA SHIELD IDIQ contract -> /", "Jerry Parker appointed CEO 2026 -> /"], "company_typ