UPDATE companies SET description='Ace Wire & Cable Co., Inc. was founded in 1952 by Jack Firestone in the New York metropolitan area. The business has remained in the Firestone family for three generations, with Jerry and Harris Firestone directly involved in daily operations. Headquartered in Avenel, New Jersey, with a second location in Woodside, Queens, the company serves the Northeast region including New York, New Jersey, Pennsylvania, and southern Connecticut.

The company operates as a master stocking distributor of wire, cable, and connectivity products for power, voice, data, video, security, building wire, and fire alarm applications. It maintains a 30,000-square-foot warehouse in Avenel and a facility in Woodside, staffed by approximately 75 employees. Value-added services performed in-house at both locations include cutting, striping, and paralleling of cable, supported by a fleet of heavy-duty tailgate trucks for delivery.

Ace Wire & Cable supplies contractors, installers, system integrators, OEMs, and end users across commercial, industrial, and institutional projects. Its product range covers building wiring systems, data communications, video, power, fire alarm, security, and industrial products. The company emphasizes a simplex purchasing process and logistics programs designed to support customers from project proposal through completion.

The firm differentiates itself by keeping essential services in-house rather than outsourcing, a practice it says ensures personalized, professional customer service with access to knowledgeable technical support. Membership in Local Union No. 3 of the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers Supply Division reflects its longstanding ties to the electrical trade.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire and cable distribution", "In-house cable cutting", "In-house cable striping", "In-house cable paralleling", "Logistics and delivery via company fleet", "Project management support", "Technical support", "Simplified purchasing process"], "industries": ["Contractors", "Installers", "System integrators", "OEMs", "End users", "Building wiring systems", "Data communications", "Voice communications", "Video communications", "Power", "Fire alarm", "Security", "Industrial products"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Heavy-duty tailgate trucks"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house cutting, striping, and paralleling services at both locations", "Own fleet of heavy-duty tailgate trucks for timely delivery", "Value-added services performed in-house, not outsourced", "Master stocking distributor with 30,000 sq ft warehouse in Avenel, NJ", "Family-owned with three generations of Firestone family involvement"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1952 by Jack Firestone -> /about-us", "Owned and operated by three generations of the Firestone family -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Avenel, NJ and Woodside, NY -> /about-us", "75 employees -> db", "Master stocking distributor of wire, cable, connectivity products -> /about-us", "In-house cutting, striping, paralleling services -> /about-us", "Own fleet of heavy-duty tailgate trucks -> /about-us", "30,000 sq ft warehouse in Avenel, NJ -> /about-us", "Serves contractors, installers, system integrators, OEMs, end users -> /about-us", "Member of Local Union No. 3 \u2013 IBEW Suppl