UPDATE companies SET description='ASD designs and builds UL 891 low-voltage switchboards, UL 67 panelboards, and NEMA 1 and 3R enclosures at its manufacturing facility in Elk Grove Village. The shop provides custom design/build engineering, including site visits to tailor gear to space constraints and utility code requirements. The company emphasizes quick turnaround, claiming lead times 8 to 10 weeks faster than national competitors.

The company differentiates itself through a leadership team with backgrounds at Eaton, Siemens, and Russelectric, collectively offering over 100 years of switchgear experience. ASD highlights its American-made production, responsiveness throughout the design/build phase, and deep expertise in utility and NEC compliance.', certifications=ARRAY['UL 891','UL 67','UL 50']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom low voltage switchboard manufacturing (UL 891)", "Custom panelboard manufacturing (UL 67)", "NEMA 1 and 3R enclosure fabrication", "Design/build engineering with site visits", "Utility code compliance engineering", "Quick-turn manufacturing"], "industries": ["Distribution warehousing", "Multi-tenant and mixed-use construction", "Education", "Healthcare", "EV charging infrastructure", "Renewable power / solar"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "8-10 weeks faster than competitors", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lead times 8\u201310 weeks faster than national competitors", "Consistent communication and responsiveness from quote through post\u2011installation", "Utility and NEC code compliance expertise from major utility projects", "All products manufactured in the USA at the Elk Grove Village facility", "Leadership team with experience from Eaton, Siemens, and Russelectric"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2005 -> db", "Headquarters in Elk Grove Village, Illinois -> db", "UL-listed power distribution systems manufacturer -> /", "Manufacturing facility in Elk Grove Village, IL -> /", "Products: UL 891 Low Voltage Switchboards, UL 67 Panelboards, NEMA 1 and 3R Enclosures -> /", "Markets: Distribution Warehousing, Multi-Tenant & Mixed Use, Education, Healthcare, EV Charging, Renewable Power / Solar -> /", "Lead times 8-10 weeks faster than competition -> /", "Over 100 years combined experience -> /", "Leadership experience from Eaton, Siemens, Russelectric -> /", "Certifications: UL 891, UL 67, UL 50 -> /about", "American-made production