UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1971 in New Bern, North Carolina, the Aftermarket Parts division of Velocity Vehicle Group (VVG) began as a supplier of replacement components for forestry and construction heavy equipment. The division operates as part of VVG, a larger vehicle group, and has grown to serve a global distributor network.

The division distributes aftermarket replacement parts compatible with a wide range of original equipment manufacturers, including Timberjack, John Deere, Tigercat, Barko, Caterpillar, Dana, Eaton, and numerous other brands.

