UPDATE companies SET description='Allen Harim Foods, based in Harbeson, Delaware, traces its origins to 1926 on the Delmarva Peninsula. The company has grown from its regional roots to become a significant poultry producer in the Mid-Atlantic, employing over 1,700 people and partnering with more than 210 family farmers.

