UPDATE companies SET description='Alpha Packaging, Inc. was founded in 1987 in Greenwood, Arkansas, as a family-owned corrugated box manufacturer. It has grown to become the largest independently owned corrugated box manufacturing company in the state, operating from a 200,000-square-foot facility on 27 acres.

The company produces a wide range of packaging solutions, including custom corrugated containers (slotted, telescope, folder, rigid, self-erecting, and interior forms), triple-wall and plastic corrugated boxes, foam inserts, and printed packaging. Its capabilities encompass design and prototyping using ArtiosCAD software, foam fabrication with heat welders, saws, and die cutters, custom printing, and vendor-managed inventory (VMI) services. The facility houses over 100 employees and maintains an online catalog of more than 13,000 ready-to-ship products, along with packaging equipment from brands such as 3M, Lantech, and EMBA.

Alpha Packaging serves manufacturers, food processors, retail packagers, and other industrial markets across a 300-mile radius, delivering via its own fleet of trucks. Its customer base includes businesses shipping consumer, commercial, and industrial goods that require protective packaging, regulatory-compliant labeling, and sustainable solutions.

The company differentiates itself through its GMP certification with a 99% audit score, membership in the AICC, and a commitment to U.S.-based manufacturing. Its 200 years of combined staff experience, in-house design engineering, and real-time VMI stock monitoring are cited as key advantages for reducing lead times and material waste.', certifications=ARRAY['GMP-certified (99% audit score)','AICC member']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom corrugated box manufacturing (slotted, telescope, folder, rigid, self-erecting, interior forms)", "Triple-wall corrugated production", "Plastic corrugated container manufacturing", "Custom foam fabrication (heat welding, sawing, die cutting)", "Custom printing (labels, barcodes, graphics)", "Packaging design and prototyping (ArtiosCAD)", "Vendor-managed inventory (VMI) services", "Packaging equipment supply (case sealers, case erectors, stretch film machines)", "Contract packaging services", "Quality assurance and testing protocols", "Sustainability consulting", "Kitting and assembly", "Consultation services"], "industries": ["Manufacturing", "Food processing", "Retail packaging", "Industrial markets", "Consumer goods", "Commercial goods"], "materials": ["Corrugated cardboard", "Triple-wall corrugated", "Plastic corrugated", "Foam (various types)", "Stretch film", "Packaging tape (3M)", "Poly bags (amber, anti-static, doorknob, flat)", "Bubble and cushioning materials"], "equipment": ["EMBA Ultima platform box erector", "Case sealers", "Case erectors", "Stretch film machines", "Heat welders", "Saws", "Die cutters", "Custom foam fabrication machinery"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Largest independently owned corrugated box manufacturer in Arkansas", "200,000 sq ft facility with own fleet serving 300-mile radius", "GMP-certified with 99% audit score and AICC membership", "Over 13,000 stocked products with real-time VMI replenishment", "In-house foam fabrication and ArtiosCAD-driven custom