UPDATE companies SET description='Alsco Uniforms operates from Casper, Wyoming, where it has served the greater Casper area — including Mills and Evansville — since its founding in 1889. The company traces its roots to the late 19th century when it pioneered the uniform rental business, establishing a model that continues to define its service today.

The business provides uniform rental programs for industrial, manufacturing, healthcare, automotive, and food-service sectors, supplying heavy-duty workwear, scrubs, lab coats, and restaurant attire. Beyond apparel, Alsco delivers linen services such as table linens and hygienically cleaned bed linens, along with first-aid kits, washroom supplies, floorcare equipment, and branded or non-branded floor mats.

Customers span healthcare facilities, automotive shops, industrial plants, food-processing operations, restaurants, and hospitality venues. The company tailors rental programs to each industry’s requirements, offering unified invoicing and dependable service schedules to keep facilities stocked without interruption.

Alsco emphasizes hygienically certified cleaning processes, a national network backing local service, and sustainability initiatives that include energy-efficient laundering and smarter logistics. With over 135 years of experience, the firm positions its longevity and standardized hygiene systems as key differentiators for businesses seeking reliable textile and facility support.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Uniform rental", "Linen rental", "Healthcare uniform rental (scrubs, lab coats)", "Restaurant uniform rental", "Industrial workwear rental", "First-aid kit supply", "Washroom supplies", "Floorcare equipment and supplies", "Floor mat rental", "Facility services", "Restroom services"], "industries": ["Healthcare", "Automotive", "Industrial", "Food Processing", "Food & Beverage", "Hospitality"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hygienically certified cleaning systems meeting rigorous hygiene and safety standards", "Local service backed by a national network", "Eco-minded practices including energy-efficient laundering and optimized logistics", "Over 135 years of industry experience", "Single unified invoice for all products and services"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1889 -> db", "Headquarters Casper, Wyoming -> db", "Uniform rental services -> /", "Linen rental services -> /", "Facility services -> /", "Industries served: Healthcare, Automotive, Industrial, Food Processing, Food & Beverage, Hospitality -> /", "Hygienically-Certified Cleaning Systems -> /", "Local Service Global Strength -> /", "Eco-Minded Always Responsible -> /", "136 Years of Experience -> /", "One unified invoice for all products & services -> /", "Dependable service schedules -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "many businesses in the greater Casper area, including Mills and Evansville, rely on Alsco Uniforms for their uniform rentals", "found