UPDATE companies SET description='Amboseli Foods LLC operates from Layton, Utah, where founder Sylvia Kapsandoy built the company on lived food memory and disciplined production. The name references Amboseli National Park in Kenya, reflecting a heritage rooted in Kenyan food culture rather than trend. What began as a home-kitchen idea grew into a food manufacturing business grounded in hands-on quality control and a standard of warmth, usefulness, and follow-through.

The company produces spice blends and consumer brands, most notably the USimplySeason® line, designed to make bold global flavor accessible for everyday cooking. Its capabilities span seasoning development, bulk blend production, private label manufacturing, and full product experience design including packaging and use-moment details. Production emphasizes sensory clarity and repeat use, with a focus on practical, approachable flavor products.

Amboseli Foods serves retail, hospitality, and food-service channels, working with food brands, retailers, entrepreneurs, and media partners. The firm frames its collaborations as strategic food partnerships for organizations building lasting food work, offering seasoning development, private label opportunities, and practical food business consultation.

The venture was started on the belief that flavor should help people cook with confidence, not confusion. Kapsandoy''s founder-led approach stresses cash-flow discipline, customer feedback loops, and patient, self-funded growth. The company highlights its NMSDC certification and memberships in Utah''s Own and ByBlack as verification of its community roots and operating standards.', certifications=ARRAY['NMSDC','Utah''s Own','ByBlack']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Spice blending", "Consumer brand development", "Private label manufacturing", "Seasoning development", "Bulk blend production", "Food product development", "Packaging design", "Quality control", "Strategic food partnerships"], "industries": ["Retail", "Hospitality", "Food Service", "Media", "Food Brands", "Entrepreneurs"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Location: Layton, Utah -> db (hq_city, hq_state_label) and pages ''/'' and ''/about''", "Founder: Sylvia Kapsandoy -> pages ''/about''", "Company name origin: Amboseli National Park, Kenya -> pages ''/about''", "Started as home-kitchen idea -> pages ''/about'' (Utah Business feature mentions 13-year journey from home-kitchen idea)", "Products: spice blends, consumer brands (USimplySeason), food experiences -> pages ''/'' and ''/about''", "Capabilities: seasoning development, bulk blends, private label, product experience design -> pages ''/'' and ''/about''", "Industries served: retail, hospitality, food service, food brands, entrepreneurs, media -> pages ''/'' and ''/about''", "Certifications: NMSDC, Utah''s Own, ByBlack -> db (certifications) and pages ''/'' and ''/about''", "Differentiators: founder-led, cash-flow discipline, self-funded growth, sensory clarity, direct conversations -> pages ''/about''", "Company type: food manufacturing company -> pages ''/about'' (growing food manufacturing company)"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "typ