UPDATE companies SET description='Architectural Wood LLC was founded in 1996 in Ronceverte, West Virginia. The company is led by CEO Carol, who emigrated from South Africa in the mid-1980s with her husband Tony and began a career as a contract millwork drafter. Over a 36-year career in the industry, she managed high-profile projects including corporate headquarters and professional sports arenas, and developed a system for producing superior shop drawings.

The shop specializes in architectural millwork fabrication, working with solid lumber, wood veneer, panels, solid surfaces, plastic laminates, metal, glass, and fabrics.

The company emphasizes a direct partnership approach with clients and maintains relationships with vendors and industry associates.

