UPDATE companies SET description='Artistic Iron Works has served the Las Vegas Valley since 1971 from a 33,000-square-foot facility in the downtown Arts District. The company is family-run and veteran-owned, operating as a full-service ornamental iron gallery and custom fabrication shop.

Its 16 welding and fabrication stations, CNC plasma cutting department, and full-service powder coating line support both one-off designs and national shipment orders. A crew of more than 40 craftsmen handles design, fabrication, and installation, with eight dedicated installation and repair teams.

Customers range from residential homeowners seeking security doors and decorative railings to commercial contractors on projects such as the Summerlin Aquatic Center Phase Two. The company ships nationally and serves the architectural metalwork, home security, and landscape design markets.

Artistic Iron Works emphasizes a turnkey approach: it manages every installation detail, promises no hidden charges, works within any budget, and guarantees its estimates. The veteran-owned, family-run structure is cited as the foundation of its customer-service philosophy.', certifications=ARRAY['Veteran-owned']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wrought iron fabrication", "Welding and fabrication", "CNC plasma cutting", "Powder coating", "Installation and repair", "Design and engineering", "Security door and window guard fabrication", "Gate and fence fabrication", "Railing and staircase fabrication", "Home decor and metal art fabrication", "Custom awning fabrication", "Hardware fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Home security", "Architectural metalwork", "Home decor", "Landscaping"], "materials": ["Wrought iron", "Steel", "Metal"], "equipment": ["16 Welding & Fabrication Stations", "CNC Plasma Cutting Departments", "Full-Service Powder Coating Line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Turnkey installation with no hidden charges", "Meets or beats any competitive bid with guaranteed estimates", "33,000 sq ft facility with 16 welding stations and CNC plasma cutting", "Over 40 skilled craftsmen and eight installation crews", "Nationwide shipping capability"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1971 -> /about-us", "Family-run, veteran-owned -> /about-us, db", "33,000 sq ft facility in Las Vegas Arts District -> /about-us, /", "Over 40 employees -> /about-us", "16 Welding & Fabrication Stations -> /about-us", "8 Installation & Repair Crews -> /about-us", "Full-Service Powder Coating -> /about-us", "CNC Plasma Cutting Departments -> /about-us", "Ships nationally -> /about-us", "Custom fabrication of doors, gates, fences, railings, stairs, decor, furniture, awnings, hardware -> /", "Turnkey installation, no hidden charges, meet or beat bids, guaranteed estimates -> /about-us", "Summerlin Aquatic