UPDATE companies SET description='Atlantic Restaurant & Supermarket Equipment operates from a 50,000-square-foot showroom and warehouse in Kearny, New Jersey. Founded in 1998, the company has spent over two decades supplying commercial kitchen equipment to businesses across the New York metropolitan area.

The distributor stocks a broad range of products including commercial cooking equipment (ranges, fryers, ovens, griddles), refrigeration equipment (reach-in refrigerators, display cases, prep tables, walk-in coolers and freezers), commercial ice machines, food preparation equipment, and supermarket display cases. The facility carries inventory from brands such as Atosa, Coldline, Hoshizaki, Pitco, and Dukers, and provides nationwide shipping.

