UPDATE companies SET description='AutoPartSource is based in Richmond, Virginia, and traces its roots to 1946. The American-owned company has operated for eight decades in the automotive aftermarket, building a business around the sale, distribution, and manufacture of brake pads, cabin air filters, and exhaust assemblies.

