UPDATE companies SET description='BA Steel LLC operates from Baltimore, Maryland, where it was founded in 1986 as Arrow Metal Fabrication and Constructors before adopting its current name. The company remains family-owned and operated, serving the Mid-Atlantic region for nearly four decades.

The shop provides full-service metal fabrication and installation, working in aluminum, stainless steel, black iron, and galvanized metals. Its capabilities include bending, sawing, shearing, punching, plate and angle rolling, plasma cutting, and protective coatings such as paint, zinc, and galvanizing.

Customers range from local, state, and federal government agencies to commercial and industrial contractors, homebuilders, general contractors, and mechanical trade contractors across the Mid-Atlantic. The company emphasizes a customized client experience with seamless communication and budgeting for projects of any size.

